{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/cn/ep8/env_story/18314010.json":{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18314010","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18314010","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1831401001:1":{"text":"你看着眼前这堆凌乱的盔甲和骨骼——这是爱丝特瑞达从班题斯手里抢来的骷髅马。尽管它现在已经很难被称为“一匹马”。","source_cn":"你看着眼前这堆凌乱的盔甲和骨骼——这是爱丝特瑞达从班题...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x23EAD9F8AD57591D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"你看着眼前这堆凌乱的盔甲和骨骼——这是爱丝特瑞达从班题斯手里抢来的骷髅马。尽管它现在已经很难被称为“一匹马”。","female":"你看着眼前这堆凌乱的盔甲和骨骼——这是爱丝特瑞达从班题斯手里抢来的骷髅马。尽管它现在已经很难被称为“一匹马”。","variant_male_record_index":"250028","variant_female_record_index":"250029","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1831401002:1":{"text":"多亏了它，从悬崖坠下的爱丝特瑞达和瑟恩才安然无恙。不过它就没那么幸运了。","source_cn":"多亏了它，从悬崖坠下的爱丝特瑞达和瑟恩才安然无恙。不过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC00339076BA19DAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1831401003:1":{"text":"如果将它重新拼凑完整，它还有行动能力吗？你忍不住好奇。","source_cn":"如果将它重新拼凑完整，它还有行动能力吗？你忍不住好奇。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA2A921A3FA8E27A4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"如果将它重新拼凑完整，它还有行动能力吗？你忍不住好奇。","female":"如果将它重新拼凑完整，它还有行动能力吗？你忍不住好奇。","variant_male_record_index":"250031","variant_female_record_index":"250032","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1831401004:1":{"text":"试试吧，试试吧。你心中的声音在诱惑着你。它只是一匹马，不会区分生者和亡灵，敌人和友军，不会主动发起攻击的。大不了，再将它打碎就是了。","source_cn":"试试吧，试试吧。你心中的声音在诱惑着你。它只是一匹马，...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5AEC4D8C482B6651","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"试试吧，试试吧。你心中的声音在诱惑着你。它只是一匹马，不会区分生者和亡灵，敌人和友军，不会主动发起攻击的。大不了，再将它打碎就是了。","female":"试试吧，试试吧。你心中的声音在诱惑着你。它只是一匹马，不会区分生者和亡灵，敌人和友军，不会主动发起攻击的。大不了，再将它打碎就是了。","variant_male_record_index":"250033","variant_female_record_index":"250034","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1831401005:1":{"text":"好奇心占领了上风，所以你顺从了自己的想法，动手帮它复原。","source_cn":"好奇心占领了上风，所以你顺从了自己的想法，动手帮它复原。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6366AF65B60BBFEA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"好奇心占领了上风，所以你顺从了自己的想法，动手帮它复原。","female":"好奇心占领了上风，所以你顺从了自己的想法，动手帮它复原。","variant_male_record_index":"250035","variant_female_record_index":"250036","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旁白":{"text":"旁白","source":"旁白","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/cn/ep8/env_story/18314020.json":{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18314020","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18314020","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"narration:2:1831402001:0":{"text":"骷髅马复原后，果然重新站了起来","source_cn":"骷髅马复原后，果然重新站了起来","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA774058C6C193B50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1831402002:0":{"text":"然后……狠狠地踹了你一脚！","source_cn":"然后……狠狠地踹了你一脚！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x485E15EC61DAC754","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"然后……狠狠地踹了你一脚！","female":"然后……狠狠地踹了你一脚！","variant_male_record_index":"250038","variant_female_record_index":"250039","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:4:1831402003:0":{"text":"在你尚未反应过来时，它便逃之夭夭","source_cn"